      "writtenOn": "2026-08-10T19:10:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Added a comment and will answer here as well for posterity.\n\nIf the real world application is doing a bunch of draws, they are snapping many Recordings over a period of time. The draws are not executed until the application/client inserts the Recording into the Context. There is the case however where the capture ends but some of the CaptureCanvases haven\u0027t snapped yet. We still want to capture these draw commands, even if they were not submitted.\n\nThis doesn\u0027t cover the case of draws that were snapped and sent to a Recording, but not submitted, but this does captrue the draws that are still kept in the CaptureCanvas.",
      "parentUuid": "b9f453bc_9733d7eb",
